0CtxDestroy – mef90 / vDef","text":"public  subroutine MEF90CtxDestroy(MEF90Ctx, ierr) MEF90CtxDestroy: Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( MEF90Ctx_Type ), intent(inout) :: MEF90Ctx integer(kind=C_INT32_T), intent(out) :: ierr","tags":"","url":"proc/mef90ctxdestroy.html"},{"title":"MEF90CtxGetTime – mef90 / vDef","text":"public  subroutine MEF90CtxGetTime(MEF90Ctx, t, ierr) MEF90CtxGetTime: Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( MEF90Ctx_Type ), intent(inout) :: MEF90Ctx The number of time steps this returns is size(t). For the exo interpolation it comes from\nthe file rather than from -time_numstep, so callers must use size(t) and not re-read\n-time_numstep to size their per-step arrays or to detect the last step. real(kind=C_DOUBLE), dimension(:), pointer :: t integer(kind=C_INT32_T), intent(out) :: ierr","tags":"","url":"proc/mef90ctxgettime.html"},{"title":"MEF90CtxGlobalOptionsSetFromOptions – mef90 / vDef","text":"public  subroutine MEF90CtxGlobalOptionsSetFromOptions(comm, prefix, options, ierr) MEF90CtxGlobalOptionsSetFromOptions: reads the MEF90-wide options.\n    options is intent(inout): whatever it holds on entry is used as the default, so that a\n    caller can override the defaults carried by MEF90CtxGlobalOptions_Type before calling. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer(kind=C_INT32_T), intent(in) :: comm character(len=*), intent(in) :: prefix type( MEF90CtxGlobalOptions_Type ), intent(inout) :: options integer(kind=C_INT32_T), intent(inout) :: ierr","tags":"","url":"proc/mef90ctxglobaloptionssetfromoptions.html"},{"title":"MEF90CtxSetFromOptions – mef90 / vDef","text":"public  subroutine MEF90CtxSetFromOptions(self, ierr) MEF90CtxSetFromOptions: initializes a MEF90Ctx_Type from options Type Bound MEF90Ctx_Type Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( MEF90Ctx_Type ), intent(inout) :: self integer(kind=C_INT32_T), intent(inout) :: ierr","tags":"","url":"proc/mef90ctxsetfromoptions.html"},{